meta {
  name: Get Fuel Summary Monthly
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/fuel/summary/:month_year
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  month_year: 2024-09
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Fuel Summary Monthly

  This request is used to get summary of fuel purchase history in the specific month and year by giving `month_year`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name       | Type   | Required | Description                    | Example |
  |------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------|---------|
  | month_year | string | yes      | Target month and year (e.g. YYYY-MM) | 2024-09 |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Fuel fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "fuel fetched",
    "data": {
      "total_fuel_volume": 40,
      "total_fuel_price": 600000,
      "total_refueling": 2
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — fuel failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "fuel not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}